('columbia', 'Columbia', 'SC', 'South Carolina', 'Richland County', '29201', '136,632', '$235,000', 'up 7%', 22, 'Columbia is South Carolina''s capital city and home to the University of South Carolina, a stable government and university economy that keeps housing demand consistent and prices accessible relative to comparable Sun Belt metros.', 'Five Points, Vista, Forest Acres, Shandon, North Columbia, Dentsville', 'Lexington, Irmo, Cayce', 'Columbia''s government and university stability keep buyers searching year-round — sellers who work with agents who understand the USC and state employee buyer pool close faster and net more at the table.', 'Reach Columbia sellers before competing agents — USC-affiliated buyers, state employees, and Fort Jackson military are always searching and our platform surfaces motivated sellers before any competitor finds them.', true)
