('myrtle-beach', 'Myrtle Beach', 'SC', 'South Carolina', 'Horry County', '29577', '35,682', '$325,000', 'up 8%', 20, 'Myrtle Beach is the Grand Strand''s most recognized destination, where 60 miles of Atlantic coastline, no state income tax on retirement income, and affordable prices draw retirees and second-home buyers from the Northeast and Midwest year-round.', 'Downtown Myrtle Beach, Arcadian Shores, Grande Dunes, Market Common, Carolina Forest', 'North Myrtle Beach, Conway, Surfside Beach', 'Myrtle Beach retiree and second-home demand from Ohio, Pennsylvania, and New York is consistent year-round — sellers who price correctly with a local market expert close fast without leaving money behind.', 'Win Myrtle Beach listings before retirees and Northeast buyers find them on Zillow — our platform connects you to motivated sellers before competing agents and brings the vacation and second-home buyers who are always searching the Grand Strand.', true)
