('greenville', 'Greenville', 'SC', 'South Carolina', 'Greenville County', '29601', '72,808', '$335,000', 'up 9%', 18, 'Greenville has become one of the South''s most celebrated mid-sized cities, a BMW and Michelin manufacturing hub with a nationally recognized Main Street, world-class Falls Park, and home prices that are drawing buyers from Charlotte, Atlanta, and beyond.', 'Downtown, Augusta Road, North Main, West Greenville, Overbrook, Berea', 'Mauldin, Simpsonville, Greer', 'Greenville''s BMW corridor and manufacturing economy keep well-qualified buyers searching year-round — sellers who list with agents who serve the corporate relocation pipeline consistently net above asking.', 'Win Greenville listings before Charlotte and Atlanta buyers find them on Zillow — our platform surfaces motivated sellers first so you can bring the BMW, Michelin, and corporate relocation buyers who close fast.', true)
