('milwaukee', 'Milwaukee', 'WI', 'Wisconsin', 'Milwaukee County', '53202', '577,222', '$225,000', 'up 8%', 22, 'Milwaukee is a Great Lakes city undergoing a dramatic revival, where a revitalized lakefront, a booming craft brewery and restaurant scene, and home prices well below comparable Midwest metros are attracting remote workers and first-time buyers from Chicago and beyond.', 'East Side, Bay View, Third Ward, Walker''s Point, Riverwest, Historic Mitchell Street', 'Wauwatosa, West Allis, Brookfield', 'Milwaukee''s affordability advantage versus Chicago keeps buyers searching year-round — sellers who work with agents who serve the Chicago overflow and remote worker market close faster and net premium prices.', 'Win Milwaukee listings before Chicago buyers and remote workers find them on Zillow — our platform connects you to motivated sellers before competing agents and brings the buyers who are priced out of Chicago but ready to close.', true)
