('madison', 'Madison', 'WI', 'Wisconsin', 'Dane County', '53703', '269,196', '$395,000', 'up 7%', 17, 'Madison is consistently ranked among America''s most livable cities, where the University of Wisconsin, state government, and a thriving biotech and healthcare sector drive steady demand from highly educated buyers who keep inventory historically low.', 'Isthmus, Willy Street, Vilas, Atwood, Monroe Street, University Heights', 'Sun Prairie, Middleton, Fitchburg', 'Madison sellers benefit from one of Wisconsin''s tightest inventory markets — university and government buyers are always searching and the right agent creates competition that maximizes your final sale price.', 'Reach Madison sellers before competing agents — UW-affiliated buyers, state employees, and Epic Systems professionals are always searching and our platform surfaces motivated sellers before any competitor finds them.', true)
