('green-bay', 'Green Bay', 'WI', 'Wisconsin', 'Brown County', '54301', '107,395', '$235,000', 'up 7%', 24, 'Green Bay is Northeast Wisconsin''s commercial center, where manufacturing, healthcare, and of course the Packers create a stable economy with home prices well below Midwest comparables that attract buyers from the Fox Valley and Chicago.', 'Downtown, Titletown District, De Pere border, Allouez, Ashwaubenon, Howard', 'De Pere, Ashwaubenon, Suamico', 'Green Bay''s manufacturing economy and Packers community pride keep buyers searching year-round — sellers who list with experienced local agents capture demand from Fox Valley buyers who are constantly looking for more space.', 'Win Green Bay listings before Milwaukee or Chicago buyers find them on Zillow — our platform connects you to motivated sellers before competing agents and brings the manufacturing and healthcare buyers who are ready to close.', true)
