('charleston-wv', 'Charleston', 'WV', 'West Virginia', 'Kanawha County', '25301', '46,692', '$165,000', 'up 6%', 30, 'Charleston is West Virginia''s capital and largest city, an energy sector and government hub where extremely affordable home prices and a Kanawha Valley setting attract buyers from across the region who find exceptional value unavailable anywhere else in the Mid-Atlantic.', 'Kanawha City, South Hills, East End, Elk City, Spring Hill', 'Dunbar, St. Albans, Nitro', 'Charleston''s unmatched affordability and government stability keep buyers searching year-round — sellers who price correctly with a local expert sell faster and net more than those who wait for the market to come to them.', 'Win Charleston WV listings before out-of-state investors and local buyers find them — our platform connects you to motivated sellers before any competing agent at West Virginia''s most accessible price points.', true)
