('sioux-falls', 'Sioux Falls', 'SD', 'South Dakota', 'Minnehaha County', '57104', '192,517', '$295,000', 'up 8%', 21, 'Sioux Falls is one of America''s fastest-growing mid-sized cities, where no state income tax, a diversified banking and healthcare economy, and a central Great Plains location are drawing remote workers and retirees from across the Midwest.', 'Downtown, McKennan Park, SculptureWalk District, Falls Park, East Side, Tea area', 'Brandon, Tea, Harrisburg', 'Sioux Falls'' no-income-tax advantage and growing economy keep buyers searching year-round — sellers who work with well-connected local agents capture demand from out-of-state buyers who are constantly discovering this city.', 'Win Sioux Falls listings before Minnesota and Iowa buyers find them on Zillow — our platform connects you to motivated sellers before competing agents and brings the no-tax-benefit buyers who are always looking.', true)
