('rapid-city', 'Rapid City', 'SD', 'South Dakota', 'Pennington County', '57701', '80,348', '$315,000', 'up 9%', 22, 'Rapid City is the gateway to Mount Rushmore, Badlands National Park, and the Black Hills, a tourism and military city where Ellsworth Air Force Base and a booming outdoor recreation economy are driving strong appreciation from out-of-state buyers.', 'Downtown Rapid City, North Rapid, West Rapid, Canyon Lake, South Rapid', 'Box Elder, Summerset, Black Hawk', 'Rapid City''s Black Hills lifestyle and military stability attract buyers from across the country who are searching for outdoor access at prices well below comparable Western markets — the right agent captures that demand.', 'Win Rapid City listings before military families and Black Hills lifestyle buyers find them on Zillow — our platform gets you to motivated sellers before any competing agent in the Ellsworth AFB and outdoor recreation market.', true)
