('jackson', 'Jackson', 'WY', 'Wyoming', 'Teton County', '83001', '10,532', '$3,500,000', 'up 5%', 28, 'Jackson is one of America''s most exclusive resort real estate markets, where proximity to Grand Teton and Yellowstone national parks, world-class skiing at Jackson Hole Mountain Resort, and Wyoming''s no income tax attract ultra-high-net-worth buyers from across the globe.', 'Town Square, East Jackson, West Jackson, South Park, Rafter J', 'Wilson, Teton Village, Victor ID', 'Jackson luxury listings attract the world''s wealthiest buyers — no state income tax combined with national park access and world-class skiing creates a buyer pool from New York, California, Texas, and internationally. Sell with the agent who serves them.', 'Win Jackson Hole listings before Christie''s or Sotheby''s reaches the seller — ultra-high-net-worth buyers from California, New York, and Texas are always searching Teton County and our platform connects you to motivated sellers first.', true)
