('washington', 'Washington', 'DC', 'Washington D.C.', 'District of Columbia', '20001', '689,545', '$625,000', 'up 4%', 18, 'Washington D.C. is one of the most recession-resistant real estate markets in the country, where federal government employment provides a floor of demand that has kept appreciation positive through every economic cycle, and world-class neighborhoods from Georgetown to Capitol Hill draw buyers globally.', 'Capitol Hill, Georgetown, Dupont Circle, Adams Morgan, Logan Circle, H Street, Anacostia', 'Arlington VA, Alexandria VA, Bethesda MD', 'D.C. federal stability means your home will sell — but the right agent ensures you capture maximum value from a buyer pool that includes government officials, lobbyists, diplomats, and tech workers all competing for limited inventory.', 'Win D.C. listings before federal buyers and lobbyists find them on Zillow — our platform connects you to motivated sellers before competing agents and brings the government and policy buyers who are always searching this market.', true)
